      "text": "1. Finalising opens a PR — it never merges. Review and branch protection on GitHub decide (FR-019, FR-029).",
      "originalText": "1. Finalising opens a PR — it never merges. Review and branch protection on GitHub decide (FR-019, FR-029).",
